  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nPlay as a dog your way.<p></p>\n<p>Become mankind’s best friend or worst nightmare! Befriend the people around you to get good stuff or just steal anything not locked down. Pick a path with dog skills to hone your dog and perfect the way you want to play.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Survive in a Vast Modern World – Scavenge, loot, and dig your way through life. Explore a world where the people and items are always changing. The city and its surroundings are yours to make your own!\n</li><li>Trade for the Best Equipment – Need a quick snack? How about a weapon or some armor? This cat has it all but drives a hard bargain. Never fear! There is always room to negotiate. Sell special items, haggle, and do favors to get those prices right where you need them to be.\n</li><li>Deck Out Your Penthouse – No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!\n</li><li>Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City – Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.\n</li><li>Take a trip to Ostrich Island – Enjoy the serene beaches and palm trees of Ostrich Island, but don’t let the tropical scenery fool you. Set up a safehouse, meet new characters, and take down the ultimate evil to all dog kind!\n</li></ul>\n",
